abstract: >-
  Research Funding Knowledge Graph (RFKG) + PipeGrobid is a research software
  project for processing scientific papers and analysing scientific funding
  through a Knowledge Graph. PipeGrobid transforms PDFs into TEI XML using
  GROBID and generates initial extraction outputs. RFKG extends that pipeline
  with ontology modelling, NER, topic modelling, online enrichment, RDF
  Knowledge Graph generation, Fuseki SPARQL publication, a FastAPI backend and
  a Streamlit frontend for exploring funding countries, organizations,
  projects, topics, acknowledgements, ORCID data and paper similarities.
